      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. im trying to flesh out the section for the people who might be skeptical or uncomfortable with the change. if i want to be fair to them, what are the actual, legitimate arguments they have? like, beyond just 'political correctness'—is there any real organizational or linguistic reasoning they use?",
